<title>HONG KONG: Trade in Honko Int'l shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in Honko Int'l shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of transistor maker and distributor Honko International Holdings Ltd was suspended on Wednesday at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said.  </p>
<p>Honko shares rose HK$0.10 to HK$1.26 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6369</p>
